{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36189","headline":"送叶秀才赴举兼呈吕少监 · 方干","name":"送叶秀才赴举兼呈吕少监","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君辞旧里一年期，艺至心身亦自知。\n尊尽离人看北斗，月寒惊鹊绕南枝。\n书回册市砧应绝，棹出村潭菊未衰。\n与尔相逢终不远，昨闻秘监在台墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}